69	     * of letters of the {@code '<REGION><FY><HASH8><CHK>'} member id (the letters before the
70	     * two-digit fiscal year that follows the region), so the locality always agrees with the
71	     * identity's region (which itself prefers the postcode over the city, defaulting to
72	     * {@code 'UNKNOWN'}). Returns {@code 'UNKNOWN'} when no member id is present.
