92	     * {@code 'PREMIUM'} when the owner's {@code membershipLevel} is 3 or more, otherwise
93	     * {@code 'STANDARD'}. AREA is {@code 'METRO'} when the owner's locality is a known region
94	     * (NSW, VIC or QLD), otherwise {@code 'REGIONAL'}. Both the membership level and the locality
95	     * are taken from {@link #formatMembershipLevel(Owner)} and {@link #formatLocality(Owner)}, so
96	     * the segment always agrees with those reported fields.
97	     */
98	    @Named("formatOwnerSegment")
