157	
158	    /**
159	     * Formats an owner's fiscal year as {@code 'FY<YY>'}, where YY is the last two digits of the
160	     * fiscal year derived from the business-day-adjusted registration date (e.g. {@code 'FY27'}),
161	     * for the read-only {@code fiscalYear} field. Each fiscal year starts on 1 July and is named by
162	     * the calendar year in which it ends. Null when the registration date is absent.
163	     */
